	(text "Switch off: EN low, nothing draws from the pack. Pole 2\nbreaks CC1 (PD renegotiates at switch-on); CC2 is direct,\nso with the plug the other way round the charger also\nworks with the switch off. Bridge the CC1 jumper to\nleave CC1 unswitched. EN divider: on above about 8.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 71.12 0)
